{"id":"95218b81d22ed54f","group":"73","path":"73/73-ex-pumping-converse-failure.md","title":"满足正规抽引条件的非正则语言","display":"ex-pumping-converse-failure — 满足正规抽引条件的非正则语言","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-ex-pumping-converse-failure","aliases":["73-ex-pumping-converse-failure"],"display":"ex-pumping-converse-failure — 满足正规抽引条件的非正则语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]","[[73-thm-regular-language-operations]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§4.1, print pp. 128–133; PDF pp. 150–155; locally proved converse counterexample","source_status":"local-example-and-proof; related third-edition topic; not a quoted book example","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":4},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-ex-pumping-converse-failure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-ex-pumping-converse-failure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-pumping-converse-failure — 满足正规抽引条件的非正则语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" href=\"?note=e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" title=\"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping\">73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa8bbf232c5a7ab8\" href=\"?note=aa8bbf232c5a7ab8\" title=\"73-thm-regular-language-operations\">73-thm-regular-language-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.1, print pp. 128–133; PDF pp. 150–155; locally proved converse counterexample"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-example-and-proof; related third-edition topic; not a quoted book example"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a,b,c\\in\\Sigma\\)</span> 两两互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,k,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j,k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{REG}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{REG}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 和词幂采用已列依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\coloneqq\\{a^ib^jc^k:i,j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\land(i=0\\lor j=k)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\coloneqq\\{a^ib^jc^k:i,j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\land(i=0\\lor j=k)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\notin\\mathsf{REG}_\\Sigma\\ \\land\\ \\forall w\\in L\\;\\bigl[|w|\\ge1\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=xyz\\land |xy|\\le1\\land |y|\\ge1\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;xy^mz\\in L)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\notin\\mathsf{REG}_\\Sigma\\ \\land\\ \\forall w\\in L\\;\\bigl[|w|\\ge1\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=xyz\\land |xy|\\le1\\land |y|\\ge1\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;xy^mz\\in L)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若词以 a 开头，抽第一个 a；j=k 在所有抽引次数下保持，删完 a 时也合法。若没有 a，则任意次数抽引第一个 b 或 c 后仍处于 i=0 分支。另一方面 L 与正则集 ab<em>c</em> 的交为 {ab<sup>nc</sup>n:n≥0}，该语言由普通抽引反证非正则。此为抽引引理逆命题的本地反例，不冒充教材中同编号例子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping","status":"resolved","id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-regular-language-operations","status":"resolved","id":"aa8bbf232c5a7ab8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-regular-language-operations]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"i,j,k,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{REG}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L\\coloneqq\\{a^ib^jc^k:i,j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\land(i=0\\lor j=k)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"L\\notin\\mathsf{REG}_\\Sigma\\ \\land\\ \\forall w\\in L\\;\\bigl[|w|\\ge1\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=xyz\\land |xy|\\le1\\land |y|\\ge1\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;xy^mz\\in L)\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1750,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-pumping-converse-failure]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-pumping-converse-failure|满足正规抽引条件的非正则语言]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","c284ffb568a496fd","e48ecbf40a3c92b6","aa8bbf232c5a7ab8"]}